{
  "version": 1,
  "preset": null,
  "selection": {
    "ui": "nativewind4",
    "data": "react-query",
    "state": "zustand",
    "storage": "kv-store",
    "forms": "react-hook-form",
    "i18n": "i18next",
    "auth": "none",
    "payments": "none",
    "analytics": "none",
    "crash": "none",
    "push": "expo-notifications",
    "backend": "none",
    "onboarding": "off",
    "location": "none",
    "widgets": "none",
    "consent": "none",
    "testing": "jest"
  },
  "applied": true,
  "modules": {
    "app": {
      "expo": {
        "plugins": [
          "expo-sqlite",
          "expo-localization",
          [
            "expo-notifications",
            {
              "icon": "./assets/images/android-icon-monochrome.png",
              "color": "#ffffff"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "ios": {
          "privacyManifests": {
            "NSPrivacyTracking": false,
            "NSPrivacyTrackingDomains": [],
            "NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypes": [
              {
                "NSPrivacyCollectedDataType": "NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypeDeviceID",
                "NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypeLinked": true,
                "NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypeTracking": false,
                "NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypePurposes": [
                  "NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypePurposeAppFunctionality"
                ]
              }
            ],
            "NSPrivacyAccessedAPITypes": [
              {
                "NSPrivacyAccessedAPIType": "NSPrivacyAccessedAPICategoryUserDefaults",
                "NSPrivacyAccessedAPITypeReasons": ["CA92.1"]
              },
              {
                "NSPrivacyAccessedAPIType": "NSPrivacyAccessedAPICategoryFileTimestamp",
                "NSPrivacyAccessedAPITypeReasons": ["C617.1"]
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "postSetup": [
      "Run `bun run start -- -c` once so Metro picks up the NativeWind transform.",
      "Link an EAS project: `bunx eas-cli init` prints the project id but cannot write into the dynamic app.config.ts - paste it into readynative.config.ts `app.easProjectId` (CI: EAS_PROJECT_ID). app.config.ts derives `extra.eas.projectId` from it; getExpoPushTokenAsync needs it, and until then usePushToken() reports `unsupported`.",
      "Run `eas credentials` and upload APNs (iOS) and FCM v1 service-account (Android) keys: https://docs.expo.dev/push-notifications/push-notifications-setup/#get-credentials-for-development-builds",
      "Remote push needs a dev build on a physical device (`eas build --profile development` or `npx expo run:ios|android`); Expo Go only delivers local notifications.",
      "On a device: `push.requestPermission()` then read `push.usePushToken().token` (or open /examples/push with `--with-examples`), and run `bun run push:test <token> \"Title\" \"Body\"` (or `npm run push:test`, `pnpm run push:test`, `yarn push:test` - it runs on plain node)."
    ],
    "doctor": [
      {
        "type": "devBuild",
        "module": "expo-notifications",
        "guide": "https://readynative.app/docs/features/push/expo-notifications#setup"
      }
    ],
    "privacy": {
      "dataSafety": [
        {
          "sdk": "Expo push (push/expo-notifications)",
          "collects": ["Push token (device id)"],
          "sharedWith": "Expo push service, APNs, FCM",
          "disclosureUrl": "https://expo.dev/privacy"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "keepModules": false,
  "examples": false
}
